[SIZE=6] 
[COLOR=#ff6600][B]Halloween Plugin[/B][/COLOR][/SIZE]

Bring the spooky spirit of Halloween to your Minecraft server!
This plugin adds fun, scary features designed to [B]surprise your players[/B] and create a creepy seasonal atmosphere.

Developed by [B]Softici s.r.o.[/B]

[B][COLOR=#ff9933]──────────────────────────[/COLOR][/B]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#ff9933]Features[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B][COLOR=#999999]Spooky Login Greeting[/COLOR][/B] 
Players are welcomed with a chilling message when they join: 
[ICODE]Spooky times have arrived... Type /halloween disable if you don't dare to be cursed.[/ICODE]
[COLOR=#00ff00]NEW in v1.5.4:[/COLOR] 30-minute cooldown prevents pumpkin farming on join!

[*][B][COLOR=#ff6600]Pumpkin Curse[/COLOR][/B] 
- Every 1–10 minutes (configurable), a carved pumpkin appears on players' heads. 
- Items are safe — the plugin checks inventory space before swapping helmets. 
- After 3 curses, players' free slots fill with stacks of pumpkins (Easter egg). 

[*][B][COLOR=#8b00ff]Grave System[/COLOR][/B] [COLOR=#ff0000]NEW in v1.6.0![/COLOR]
Build elaborate graves and summon an [B]undead army[/B] to test your combat skills!

[B]How to Build a Grave:[/B]

[LIST=1]
[*][B]Create the Coffin[/B] (underground):
[LIST]
[*]Place 3 wood planks in a row, 1 block below ground level
[*]Any wood planks work!
[/LIST]

[*][B]Cover with Dirt[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Place 3 dirt blocks directly above the coffin
[/LIST]

[*][B]Place the Sign[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Put a sign on the middle dirt block
[*]Write "RIP", "R.I.P.", "R.i.P.", or any variation
[/LIST]

[*][B]Build the Cross[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]On one side of the dirt, place 4 stone walls vertically
[*]At the 3rd level (counting from bottom), add 2 stone walls horizontally (left and right)
[*]Creates a cross shape
[/LIST]

[*][B]Add Candles[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Place at least 1 candle on the opposite side of the cross
[*]On top of the dirt blocks
[/LIST]

[*][B]Light the Candle[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Right-click the candle with flint & steel
[*]The grave awakens!
[/LIST]
[/LIST]

[B]What Happens:[/B]

[LIST=1]
[*][B]Dramatic Animation[/B] (every 3 seconds):
[LIST]
[*]Cross sinks block by block (4 stages)
[*]Dirt layer vanishes with sign and candles
[*]Coffin transforms into nether bricks
[/LIST]

[*][B]Undead Army Spawns[/B]:
[LIST]
[*][B]3 Skeletons[/B] (default)
[*][B]2 Zombies[/B] (default)
[*][B]2 Skeleton Riders[/B] on skeleton horses (default)
[*][B]3 Zombie Riders[/B] on zombie horses (default)
[*]All mobs wear pumpkin helmets and glow!
[/LIST]

[*][B]Buffed Stats[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]+30% health
[*]+50% damage
[*]+20% speed
[*]Drop 3 pumpkins each + extra XP
[/LIST]

[*][B]Defeat All Mobs[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Chest appears with rewards
[*]XP distributed among participants
[/LIST]
[/LIST]

[B]Rewards:[/B]

[B]Chest Contains:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]10-32 Carved Pumpkins
[*]2-5 Cakes
[*]0-1 Skeleton Skull (50% chance)
[*]0-1 Zombie Head (50% chance)
[*]1 Treasure Map
[*]5 Diamonds
[/LIST]

[B]Participant XP:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Total pool: 10 levels worth of XP (level 1 equivalent)
[*]Distributed based on kill contribution
[*]Example: Kill 50% of mobs = 50% of XP
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]⚙️ Configuration[/B][/SIZE]

[B]New Config Section:[/B]

[CODE=yaml]
# Grave System (v1.6.0+)
grave:
  enabled: true
  spawns:
    skeleton: 3  # Number of skeletons to spawn
    zombie: 2  # Number of zombies to spawn
    skeleton_horse: 2  # Number of skeleton riders on horses
    zombie_horse: 3  # Number of zombie riders on horses
  health_boost: 1.3  # Multiply mob health by this (1.3 = 30% more health)
  damage_boost: 1.5  # Multiply mob damage by this (1.5 = 50% more damage)
  speed_boost: 0.2  # Add this to mob speed
  pumpkin_drops_per_mob: 3  # Pumpkins dropped by each grave mob
  xp_per_mob: 5  # Extra XP per mob kill
  rewards:
    pumpkins_min: 10
    pumpkins_max: 32
    cakes_min: 2
    cakes_max: 5
    skeleton_skull_chance: 0.5  # 50% chance
    zombie_head_chance: 0.5  # 50% chance
    diamonds: 5
    treasure_map: 1
[/CODE]

[B]New Messages:[/B]

[CODE=yaml]
graveAwaken:
  - "🪦 %PLAYER% has disturbed an ancient grave... something evil awakens!"
  - "💀 %PLAYER% has awakened old evil from beyond the grave!"
  - "👻 The dead rise as %PLAYER% disturbs their eternal rest!"
  - "⚰️ %PLAYER% has broken the seal on a cursed grave!"

graveCurseBroken:
  - "✨ %PLAYER% has broken the curse of the grave and defeated the undead army!"
  - "🏆 %PLAYER% has vanquished the grave guardians and lifted the curse!"
  - "⭐ The grave's curse is broken thanks to %PLAYER%!"
  - "🎉 %PLAYER% and their allies have defeated the undead horde!"
[/CODE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🛡️ Protection Systems[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Disabled Players:[/B] Cannot trigger grave events
[*][B]Global Disable:[/B] [FONT=Courier New]/halloween off[/FONT] despawns all active grave mobs
[*][B]Error Messages:[/B] Helpful messages if Halloween is disabled
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🎮 Gameplay Tips[/B][/SIZE]

[B]For Players:[/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Team up![/B] Graves spawn many mobs - bring friends
[*][B]Be prepared:[/B] Diamond/netherite armor recommended
[*][B]Track contributions:[/B] Everyone who helps gets XP
[*][B]Farm pumpkins:[/B] Each mob drops 3 pumpkins (default)
[/LIST]

[B]For Server Admins:[/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Adjust difficulty:[/B] Change spawn counts in config
[*][B]Balance rewards:[/B] Customize chest loot
[*][B]Test first:[/B] Build a grave in creative to test settings
[*][B]Monitor performance:[/B] Large battles may impact server
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]📊 Technical Details[/B][/SIZE]

[B]Structure Validation:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Checks for exact 3x1 coffin (wood planks)
[*]Validates 3x1 dirt layer above
[*]Confirms RIP sign (case-insensitive)
[*]Verifies cross structure (4 vertical + 2 horizontal stone walls)
[*]Requires at least 1 candle on opposite side
[/LIST]

[B]Animation System:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]3-second intervals between stages
[*]4 cross sinking stages
[*]1 dirt removal stage
[*]1 coffin transformation stage
[*]Total animation time: ~18 seconds
[/LIST]

[B]Mob Tracking:[/B]
[LIST]
[*]UUIDs stored per grave
[*]Kill attribution tracked per player
[*]XP calculated by contribution percentage
[*]Cleanup on grave completion or global disable
[/LIST]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🐛 Known Issues[/B][/SIZE]

None currently known. Please report any bugs!

