[SIZE=5][B]📦 Installation[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST=1]
[*][B]Backup[/B] your server
[*]Stop your server
[*]Replace old [FONT=Courier New]halloween-plugin-1.5.4.jar[/FONT] with [FONT=Courier New]halloween-plugin-1.6.0.jar[/FONT]
[*]Start server (config auto-updates with new grave section)
[*]Enjoy!
[/LIST]

